                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.23"&gt;11.3.23&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Yield from dispatcher more eagerly during shutdown by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5463730996" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22240" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22240/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22240"&gt;#22240&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix menu auto closing when reopened by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5744654228" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22399" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22399/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22399"&gt;#22399&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fixes for various native memory/resource management issues. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6276642877" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22757" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22757/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22757"&gt;#22757&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Use 32-bit visual for EGL alpha configs on Mesa without EGL_MESA_x11_native_visual_id by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5835531754" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22452" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22452/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22452"&gt;#22452&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/compare/11.3.22...11.3.23"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;11.3.22...11.3.23&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/12.1.6"&gt;12.1.6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Don't allocate the radii array in &lt;code&gt;PushClip(RoundedRect)&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/LIFEfreedom/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/LIFEfreedom"&gt;@LIFEfreedom&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6196215137" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22698" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22698/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22698"&gt;#22698&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Add &lt;code&gt;TableViewColumn&lt;/code&gt; minimum and maximum width limits by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mamoreau-devolutions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mamoreau-devolutions"&gt;@mamoreau-devolutions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6208690230" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22707" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22707/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22707"&gt;#22707&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Use visible cell content as the &lt;code&gt;TableView&lt;/code&gt; row automation name by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mamoreau-devolutions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mamoreau-devolutions"&gt;@mamoreau-devolutions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6208698480" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22709" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22709/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22709"&gt;#22709&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Expose the X11 window id as an AT-SPI attribute on window nodes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jmacato/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jmacato"&gt;@jmacato&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6178727283" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22687" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22687/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22687"&gt;#22687&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix null codec handling in scaled bitmap decoding by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/bconnell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/bconnell"&gt;@bconnell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6175439613" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22686" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22686/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22686"&gt;#22686&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Show glob examples in &lt;code&gt;FilePickerFileType.Patterns&lt;/code&gt; docs as code by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Prince-5785/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Prince-5785"&gt;@Prince-5785&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6241736868" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22736" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22736/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22736"&gt;#22736&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Release the Vulkan device lock when &lt;code&gt;BeginDraw&lt;/code&gt; throws by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/18Abhinav07/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/18Abhinav07"&gt;@18Abhinav07&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6245874340" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22743" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22743/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22743"&gt;#22743&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Fix various native memory/resource management issues by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6276642877" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22757" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22757/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22757"&gt;#22757&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Set &lt;code&gt;IsActive&lt;/code&gt; before raising &lt;code&gt;Window.Activated&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/joaomoa/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/joaomoa"&gt;@joaomoa&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6210865913" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22716" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22716/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22716"&gt;#22716&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Fix &lt;code&gt;Span.OnInlinesChanged&lt;/code&gt; never being called by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6258135777" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22746" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22746/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22746"&gt;#22746&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;XAML – Fix keyed &lt;code&gt;Color&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;String&lt;/code&gt; resources failing to load at runtime on Mono by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/NicholasLachapelle/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/NicholasLachapelle"&gt;@NicholasLachapelle&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6212892743" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22724" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22724/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22724"&gt;#22724&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android – Close cursors before disposing the storage item by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6181707975" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22688" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22688/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22688"&gt;#22688&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iOS – Don't wrap an &lt;code&gt;InteropAutomationPeer&lt;/code&gt; during accessibility traversal by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/NicholasLachapelle/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/NicholasLachapelle"&gt;@NicholasLachapelle&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6164652236" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22683" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22683/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22683"&gt;#22683&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Browser – Fix clipboard in non-secure contexts by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/izakusilov/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/izakusilov"&gt;@izakusilov&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6129632443" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22656" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22656/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22656"&gt;#22656&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Browser – Fix swapped right and bottom safe area insets by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/18Abhinav07/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/18Abhinav07"&gt;@18Abhinav07&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6245872412" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/22741" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22741/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/22741"&gt;#22741&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/compare/12.1.5...12.1.6"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;12.1.5...12.1.6&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
